{
 "loan": {
  "version": 2,
  "id": "loan",
  "title": "房贷月供估算",
  "inputs": [
   {
    "id": "loan",
    "kind": "number",
    "label": "贷款金额（万元）",
    "initial": 120,
    "min": 50,
    "max": 300,
    "step": 5
   },
   {
    "id": "rate",
    "kind": "number",
    "label": "年利率（%）",
    "initial": 3.2,
    "min": 2,
    "max": 6,
    "step": 0.05
   },
   {
    "id": "years",
    "kind": "number",
    "label": "贷款年限（年）",
    "initial": 30,
    "min": 5,
    "max": 30,
    "step": 5
   }
  ],
  "state": [],
  "derived": [
   {
    "id": "p",
    "expr": "$loan * 10000"
   },
   {
    "id": "r",
    "expr": "$rate / 1200"
   },
   {
    "id": "n",
    "expr": "$years * 12"
   },
   {
    "id": "pay",
    "expr": "payment(r, n, p)"
   },
   {
    "id": "interest",
    "expr": "pay * n - p"
   }
  ],
  "resources": [],
  "blocks": [
   {
    "id": "intro",
    "kind": "text",
    "markdown": "按**等额本息**：贷款 {{$loan}} 万、年利率 {{$rate}}%、{{$years}} 年，**每月还 {{format(pay, 'number', 0)}} 元**，一共付利息约 {{format(interest, 'wan', 1)}}。"
   },
   {
    "id": "controls",
    "kind": "controls",
    "inputIds": [
     "loan",
     "rate",
     "years"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "stats",
    "kind": "stats",
    "items": [
     {
      "label": "月供",
      "value": "format(pay, 'number', 0) + ' 元'"
     },
     {
      "label": "总利息",
      "value": "format(interest, 'wan', 1)"
     },
     {
      "label": "总还款",
      "value": "format(pay * n, 'wan', 1)"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "balance",
    "kind": "table",
    "title": "每 5 年剩多少本金",
    "columns": [
     "年末",
     "剩余本金"
    ],
    "rows": "each(range(5, $years, 5), 'y', ['第 ' + y + ' 年', format(pay * (1 - pow(1 + r, y * 12 - n)) / r, 'wan', 1)])"
   },
   {
    "id": "how",
    "kind": "disclosure",
    "title": "怎么算的",
    "markdown": "月利率 r = 年利率 ÷ 12，期数 n = 年限 × 12；月供 = 本金 × r ÷ (1 − (1 + r)^−n)。提前还款和利率调整不在这张表里。"
   },
   {
    "id": "act",
    "kind": "actions",
    "items": [
     {
      "id": "more",
      "kind": "model",
      "label": "按这组取值算提前还款",
      "prompt": "按这组取值，帮我算提前还 20 万能省多少利息"
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
 "split": {
  "version": 2,
  "id": "split",
  "title": "聚餐 AA",
  "inputs": [
   {
    "id": "total",
    "kind": "number",
    "label": "账单（元）",
    "initial": 860,
    "min": 0,
    "max": 10000,
    "step": 10
   },
   {
    "id": "people",
    "kind": "number",
    "label": "人数",
    "initial": 5,
    "min": 1,
    "max": 20,
    "step": 1
   },
   {
    "id": "tip",
    "kind": "choice",
    "label": "服务费",
    "initial": "none",
    "options": [
     {
      "id": "none",
      "label": "不加"
     },
     {
      "id": "ten",
      "label": "10%"
     },
     {
      "id": "fifteen",
      "label": "15%"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "state": [],
  "derived": [
   {
    "id": "rate",
    "expr": "$tip == 'ten' ? 0.1 : $tip == 'fifteen' ? 0.15 : 0"
   },
   {
    "id": "grand",
    "expr": "$total * (1 + rate)"
   },
   {
    "id": "each_pay",
    "expr": "ceil(grand / $people)"
   }
  ],
  "resources": [],
  "blocks": [
   {
    "id": "intro",
    "kind": "text",
    "markdown": "{{$people}} 人平摊，每人 **{{each_pay}} 元**（向上取整到元，多出的 {{round(each_pay * $people - grand, 2)}} 元可以抵下次）。"
   },
   {
    "id": "controls",
    "kind": "controls",
    "inputIds": [
     "total",
     "people",
     "tip"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "stats",
    "kind": "stats",
    "items": [
     {
      "label": "每人",
      "value": "each_pay + ' 元'"
     },
     {
      "label": "合计",
      "value": "format(grand, 'number', 2) + ' 元'"
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
 "convert": {
  "version": 2,
  "id": "convert",
  "title": "单位换算",
  "inputs": [
   {
    "id": "amount",
    "kind": "number",
    "label": "数值",
    "initial": 100,
    "min": 0,
    "max": 1000,
    "step": 1
   },
   {
    "id": "pair",
    "kind": "choice",
    "label": "换算",
    "initial": "kmmi",
    "options": [
     {
      "id": "kmmi",
      "label": "公里 → 英里"
     },
     {
      "id": "kglb",
      "label": "公斤 → 磅"
     },
     {
      "id": "cf",
      "label": "摄氏 → 华氏"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "state": [],
  "derived": [
   {
    "id": "result",
    "expr": "$pair == 'kmmi' ? $amount * 0.621371 : $pair == 'kglb' ? $amount * 2.20462 : $amount * 9 / 5 + 32"
   },
   {
    "id": "unit",
    "expr": "$pair == 'kmmi' ? '英里' : $pair == 'kglb' ? '磅' : '°F'"
   }
  ],
  "resources": [],
  "blocks": [
   {
    "id": "intro",
    "kind": "text",
    "markdown": "{{$amount}} 换算后是 **{{format(result, 'number', 2)}} {{unit}}**。"
   },
   {
    "id": "controls",
    "kind": "controls",
    "inputIds": [
     "amount",
     "pair"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "near",
    "kind": "table",
    "title": "附近的整数",
    "columns": [
     "原值",
     "换算后"
    ],
    "rows": "each(range(max(0, $amount - 20), $amount + 20, 10), 'v', [v, format($pair == 'kmmi' ? v * 0.621371 : $pair == 'kglb' ? v * 2.20462 : v * 9 / 5 + 32, 'number', 1)])"
   }
  ]
 },
 "budget": {
  "version": 2,
  "id": "budget",
  "title": "月度预算 50/30/20",
  "inputs": [
   {
    "id": "income",
    "kind": "number",
    "label": "到手月薪（元）",
    "initial": 15000,
    "min": 3000,
    "max": 80000,
    "step": 500
   },
   {
    "id": "rent",
    "kind": "number",
    "label": "房租（元）",
    "initial": 4000,
    "min": 0,
    "max": 30000,
    "step": 100
   }
  ],
  "state": [],
  "derived": [
   {
    "id": "needs",
    "expr": "$income * 0.5"
   },
   {
    "id": "wants",
    "expr": "$income * 0.3"
   },
   {
    "id": "save",
    "expr": "$income * 0.2"
   },
   {
    "id": "rent_share",
    "expr": "percent($rent, $income)"
   }
  ],
  "resources": [],
  "blocks": [
   {
    "id": "intro",
    "kind": "text",
    "markdown": "按 50/30/20：每月存 **{{format(save, 'number', 0)}} 元**，一年 {{format(save * 12, 'wan', 1)}}。房租占收入 {{round(rent_share, 1)}}%{{rent_share > 30 ? '，超过三成，必需开支会很紧' : ''}}。"
   },
   {
    "id": "controls",
    "kind": "controls",
    "inputIds": [
     "income",
     "rent"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "stats",
    "kind": "stats",
    "items": [
     {
      "label": "必需",
      "value": "format(needs, 'number', 0)"
     },
     {
      "label": "想要",
      "value": "format(wants, 'number', 0)"
     },
     {
      "label": "储蓄",
      "value": "format(save, 'number', 0)"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "left",
    "kind": "table",
    "columns": [
     "类别",
     "预算",
     "扣房租后"
    ],
    "rows": "[['必需', format(needs, 'number', 0), format(needs - $rent, 'number', 0)], ['想要', format(wants, 'number', 0), '—'], ['储蓄', format(save, 'number', 0), '—']]"
   }
  ]
 },
 "vocab": {
  "version": 2,
  "id": "vocab",
  "title": "GRE 高频词 · 第 1 组",
  "inputs": [],
  "state": [
   {
    "id": "words",
    "initial": [
     {
      "word": "abate",
      "meaning": "减弱；减轻",
      "example": "The storm began to abate by evening."
     },
     {
      "word": "aberrant",
      "meaning": "异常的；偏离常规的",
      "example": "His aberrant behavior worried his friends."
     },
     {
      "word": "abscond",
      "meaning": "潜逃",
      "example": "The cashier absconded with the money."
     },
     {
      "word": "accolade",
      "meaning": "赞扬；荣誉",
      "example": "The film won every accolade."
     },
     {
      "word": "acerbic",
      "meaning": "尖刻的",
      "example": "Her acerbic review stung the author."
     },
     {
      "word": "adamant",
      "meaning": "坚定不移的",
      "example": "He was adamant that he was right."
     },
     {
      "word": "admonish",
      "meaning": "告诫",
      "example": "The teacher admonished the class for talking."
     },
     {
      "word": "adulation",
      "meaning": "奉承；过分赞扬",
      "example": "The star enjoyed the adulation of fans."
     },
     {
      "word": "aesthetic",
      "meaning": "审美的",
      "example": "The building has little aesthetic appeal."
     },
     {
      "word": "affable",
      "meaning": "和蔼可亲的",
      "example": "Our affable host greeted everyone."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "i",
    "initial": 0
   },
   {
    "id": "known",
    "initial": []
   },
   {
    "id": "again",
    "initial": []
   }
  ],
  "derived": [
   {
    "id": "total",
    "expr": "count(words)"
   },
   {
    "id": "done",
    "expr": "i >= total"
   },
   {
    "id": "w",
    "expr": "done ? null : words[i]"
   }
  ],
  "resources": [],
  "blocks": [
   {
    "id": "intro",
    "kind": "text",
    "markdown": "第 {{min(i + 1, total)}} / {{total}} 个词。先自己想意思，再展开核对。",
    "when": {
     "expr": "not done"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "word",
    "kind": "text",
    "markdown": "### {{w.word}}\n\n*{{w.example}}*",
    "when": {
     "expr": "not done"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "meaning",
    "kind": "disclosure",
    "title": "看释义",
    "markdown": "{{w.meaning}}",
    "when": {
     "expr": "not done"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "finished",
    "kind": "text",
    "markdown": "这一组背完了：认识 {{count(known)}} 个{{count(again) ? '，需要再看：' + join(again, '、') : ''}}。",
    "when": {
     "expr": "done"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "stats",
    "kind": "stats",
    "items": [
     {
      "label": "已认识",
      "value": "count(known)"
     },
     {
      "label": "再看一次",
      "value": "count(again)"
     },
     {
      "label": "还剩",
      "value": "total - i"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "mark",
    "kind": "actions",
    "items": [
     {
      "id": "again",
      "kind": "set",
      "label": "再看一次",
      "steps": [
       {
        "append": "again",
        "value": "w.word"
       },
       {
        "set": "i",
        "to": "i + 1"
       }
      ],
      "disabled": "done"
     },
     {
      "id": "know",
      "kind": "set",
      "label": "认识",
      "steps": [
       {
        "append": "known",
        "value": "w.word"
       },
       {
        "set": "i",
        "to": "i + 1"
       }
      ],
      "disabled": "done"
     },
     {
      "id": "restart",
      "kind": "set",
      "label": "从头再来",
      "steps": [
       {
        "reset": "i"
       },
       {
        "reset": "known"
       },
       {
        "reset": "again"
       }
      ],
      "disabled": "i == 0"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "act",
    "kind": "actions",
    "items": [
     {
      "id": "quiz",
      "kind": "model",
      "label": "用这 10 个词出一份小测验",
      "prompt": "用这一组的 10 个词给我出一份小测验"
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
 "steps": {
  "version": 2,
  "id": "steps",
  "title": "换水龙头阀芯",
  "inputs": [],
  "state": [
   {
    "id": "steps",
    "initial": [
     "关掉总水阀，打开水龙头放掉余水",
     "用扳手拧下龙头底部的压盖螺母",
     "取出旧阀芯，带去五金店买同型号",
     "装上新阀芯，按原样拧回压盖",
     "打开总水阀，检查是否还滴水"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "at",
    "initial": 0
   }
  ],
  "derived": [
   {
    "id": "last",
    "expr": "count(steps) - 1"
   }
  ],
  "resources": [],
  "blocks": [
   {
    "id": "intro",
    "kind": "text",
    "markdown": "第 **{{at + 1}}** 步，共 {{count(steps)}} 步：{{steps[at]}}"
   },
   {
    "id": "all",
    "kind": "table",
    "columns": [
     "步骤",
     "做什么",
     "状态"
    ],
    "rows": "each(range(0, last), 'k', [k + 1, steps[k], k < at ? '已完成' : k == at ? '进行中' : ''])"
   },
   {
    "id": "nav",
    "kind": "actions",
    "items": [
     {
      "id": "prev",
      "kind": "set",
      "label": "上一步",
      "steps": [
       {
        "set": "at",
        "to": "at - 1"
       }
      ],
      "disabled": "at == 0"
     },
     {
      "id": "next",
      "kind": "set",
      "label": "下一步",
      "steps": [
       {
        "set": "at",
        "to": "at + 1"
       }
      ],
      "disabled": "at == last"
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
 "pick": {
  "version": 2,
  "id": "pick",
  "title": "轻薄本怎么挑",
  "inputs": [
   {
    "id": "kind",
    "kind": "choice",
    "label": "看哪类",
    "initial": "all",
    "options": [
     {
      "id": "all",
      "label": "全部"
     },
     {
      "id": "light",
      "label": "轻薄"
     },
     {
      "id": "pro",
      "label": "性能"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "order",
    "kind": "choice",
    "label": "排序",
    "initial": "price",
    "options": [
     {
      "id": "price",
      "label": "价格"
     },
     {
      "id": "weight",
      "label": "重量"
     },
     {
      "id": "battery",
      "label": "续航"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "budget",
    "kind": "number",
    "label": "预算上限（元）",
    "initial": 12000,
    "min": 6000,
    "max": 15000,
    "step": 500
   }
  ],
  "state": [
   {
    "id": "items",
    "initial": [
     {
      "name": "MacBook Air 13",
      "kind": "light",
      "price": 7999,
      "weight": 1.24,
      "battery": 18
     },
     {
      "name": "MacBook Pro 14",
      "kind": "pro",
      "price": 12999,
      "weight": 1.55,
      "battery": 22
     },
     {
      "name": "ThinkPad X1 Carbon",
      "kind": "light",
      "price": 9999,
      "weight": 1.12,
      "battery": 15
     },
     {
      "name": "Dell XPS 14",
      "kind": "pro",
      "price": 10999,
      "weight": 1.68,
